# one command delegates every open agent step
# cmd: W delegate --open --feature demo

-- exit --
0
-- output --
WAVE check plan run review accept
DELEGATE plan -> idev-verifier
LEASE none (this kind does not write product code)
DELEGATE run -> idev-verifier
LEASE none (this kind does not write product code)
DELEGATE review -> idev-reviewer
LEASE none (this kind does not write product code)
DELEGATE accept -> idev-verifier
LEASE none (this kind does not write product code)
